      "title": "wslua: Fix some leaks on errors with gcrypt",
      "message": "wslua: Fix some leaks on errors with gcrypt\n\nAvoid leaking when there are errors (which is tested in the gcrypt.lua test\nscript) so that the tests pass when built with ASAN.\n\nAlso fix the GcryptCipher.open related tests. There was an\nunnecessarily defined function expecting to be passed in a\nGcryptCipher object, but none of the tests passed in such a\nparameter (since the test opens it), so the wrong parameters\nwere passed to the open function. (The ones that failed still\nfailed, just differently.)\n\nFixup 0d74b79e2886252eb9a80ad749de83c161212f68\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2025-05-25T19:16:24.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
